\par\b\fs28 \u167?7 Podcast rendering\b0\fs24\par


\par One physical image: the people watching the goat leave \u8212? further and further, until it is out of sight. What has been confessed you need not keep nursing as though holding on shows more reverence; God carries it away. And the second half: whoever has received like that comes outside and suddenly sees the person he first walked past.\par



